# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock is committed on purpose: this crate ships a binary, and a
# locked dependency graph is what makes a build reproducible and what the
# declared MSRV is tested against.

# Coverage
*.profraw
**/coverage/

# ATTEST internal (keys and receipts stay local; the trust store is committed)
.attest/*
!.attest/trust/
*.attest-receipt

